<TestCaseEntity>
   <description>Select Start date sorting and verify that the first three opportunity rows are in ascending chronological order by comparing Row 1 with Row 2 and Row 2 with Row 3. Read and parse displayed dates at runtime so the testcase does not depend on fixed date values.</description>
